## SQ-CMV-01 | no tested-range WARN, no Common mixin apply error, all Common startup files loaded
@group A
@commands Boot the full pack: `grep -nE "outside the tested range\|Mixin apply.*creativecommon\|creativecommon.mixins.json.*(fail\|error)" logs/latest.log \| head`; `grep -n "creativecommon: .* files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log`
@pass no line from the first grep; the startup line shows all Common files loaded
@fails a range that misses the pack's version (fix the bound in `MOD_RANGE`)
@from batches/r1113/c3_a1.qb passed
bootreject outside the tested range
bootreject Mixin apply.*creativecommon|creativecommon\.mixins\.json.*(fail|error)
shell grep -qE "\[jar-startup\] creativecommon: ([0-9]+) of \1 files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log

## SQ-CMV-02 | Common alone boots, reloads clean; no class or mixin error; no script error
@group B
@commands **Common alone** (`@modset cc_only alone`: Forge, KubeJS, Rhino, Architectury and Common, config empty, probe-only kubejs); boot, `/reload`, stop
@pass boots and stops clean; no `NoClassDefFoundError`, `ClassNotFoundException` or mixin error in `latest.log`; no script error in `logs/kubejs/`
@fails a mixin into another mod without a `NEEDS_MOD` row, or Java code reaching an optional mod's classes without a load check
@from batches/r1113/c3_co.qb
@modset cc_only alone
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
> reload
waitlog Reloading!|reload 60
sleep 15
shell cat logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -E "\[ERROR\]" | head -5; test "$(cat logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -cE "\[ERROR\]")" = 0
reject NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException
look stop is clean (the runner's stop: no exception after "Stopping server" in latest.log). SQ-CCO-13 (r1107cco) passed the same set on the 2026-11-07 jar; this is the 2026-11-12 jar

## SQ-CMV-03 | Armor Trims 1.4.0 outside [1.3.3,1.4): one WARN, its mixins off, boots clean
@group B
@commands SQ-CMV-02's folder plus a gated mod with no further dependencies (Armor Trims or Nock Enough Arrows; check its `mods.toml`) whose `mods.toml` `version` is rewritten above the range (for example `1.4.0` / `1.3.0`, a copy in the scratchpad, never the real jar); boot
@pass one WARN `[creativecommon] <mod> <version> is outside the tested range ...: its mixins are off`; boots clean
@fails `GatedMixinPlugin.tableModOn`
@from batches/r1113/c3_co2.qb passed
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect \[creativecommon\] armor_trims 1\.4\.0 is outside the tested range \[1\.3\.3,1\.4\): its mixins are off
shell grep -c "is outside the tested range" logs/latest.log; test "$(grep -c "armor_trims 1.4.0 is outside the tested range" logs/latest.log)" = 1
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|ArmorTrimsLargeItemListsMixin.*(fail|error)

