## SQ-CMV-04 | Common's generated config keeps vanilla defaults
@group B
@commands Vanilla defaults (2026-11-07, creative_engineering.md 7.1): on `@modset cc_only alone` (config empty, so Common writes its defaults; no pack advancement drop); after the boot `grep -nE "^\s*(enabled|packOrder|tutorial|advancement|traderIntervalTicks|commonTrades|rareTrades|disabled) =" config/creativecommon-common.toml`
@pass the generated file has advancements enabled = true, wandering_trader enabled = false with 24000 / 5 / 1, packOrder = false, tutorial and advancement = true, creative_menu disabled = false (the config keys only; the advancement grant check was dropped, owner ruling 2026-11-18: the pack drops advancements)
@fails a default left at the pack value in `CommonConfig`
@from batches/r1108cge/b5_cco.qb
@modset cc_only alone
shell grep -nE "^\s*(enabled|packOrder|tutorial|advancement|traderIntervalTicks|commonTrades|rareTrades|disabled|gravityLimitDimensions) =" config/creativecommon-common.toml
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload add 0 0
> pbot spawn cge06 0 75 0 minecraft:the_end survival
sleep 3
look shell.txt: advancements enabled = true, wandering_trader enabled = false with 24000 / 5 / 1, packOrder = false, tutorial and advancement = true, creative_menu disabled = false

